'''Moonsilk Hollow''' is a vale located in [[Moonwhisper Coast]]. It is inhabited by [[moth]]s that produce powerful silk full of potent energy which is desired by the [[Moro'gai tribe]] for its healing properties.<ref>{{questlong|Neutral|54|Silken Song}}</ref>

